<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-042" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names" source-id="s-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names-ws1507997">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0000" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>子<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0002" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">德元</persName>，有意尚。至車騎長史。<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0015" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">德元</persName>初名<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0019" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">湛</persName>，世祖謂<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0024" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0028" ref="h3c_ulm_pto">劉湛</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0031" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>，竝不善終，此非佳名也。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0046" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>乃改之。至是與弟晉安王友<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names:p001:m0059" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_B">德和</persName>俱被誅。</p>
</text>
